# Base URL of the published 415-docs site (no trailing slash).
#
# The Canvas glossary builder (gazprea/_ext/build_canvas_glossary.py) joins
# this with "/<project>/<page>.html#<anchor>" to turn the Sphinx :ref:
# cross-references in the glossary into live links on the deployed site,
# because a standalone Canvas page cannot resolve sphinx-internal targets.
# The per-target page and anchor come from the Sphinx objects.inv inventory.
#
# Keep this in sync with README.md and the intersphinx_mapping in
# gazprea/conf.py.
https://cmput415.github.io/415-docs
